          "title": "Chronological timeline",
          "bullets": [
            {
              "id": "2a.1",
              "text": "Warnings issued for Estenwick and Dray Corners on May 19 at 15:36 UTC; evacuations from Estenwick and Dray Corners at 19:07 UTC; 3 fatalities confirmed in Millrow district at 21:54 UTC; 9 total deaths in Ostley County reported on May 20 at 14:26 UTC; Route 12 and grain elevator destroyed by May 19, restored by May 23 at 12:20 UTC; Estenwick Consolidated School destroyed on May 22.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
